ef=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/directory_entry\"><span class=\"kw2223\">std::<span class=\"me2\">filesystem</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">directory_entry</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>Entry <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> entry <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/directory_iterator\"><span class=\"kw2224\">std::<span class=\"me2\">filesystem</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">directory_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>dir<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> to_string<span class=\"br0\">(</span>entry.<span class=\"me1\">last_write_time</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"&nbsp;: \"</span>\n                  <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> entry.<span class=\"me1\">path</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">filename</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Wed Sep  6 13:37:13.960314156 2023&nbsp;: \"main.cpp\"\nWed Sep  6 13:37:42.690271828 2023&nbsp;: \"a.out\"</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/last_write_time\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>last_write_time</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></sp